HONEST recur=(1, 3) expect (1, 3) -> GREEN
HONEST pruned recur=None expect None -> GREEN
HONEST newest_kind='timeout' expect timeout -> GREEN
MUTANT M1 pruned side channel answers 0:0 instead of none -> RED as intended (recur=(1, 3) pruned=(0, 0) kind='timeout')
MUTANT M2 every failing source counts as recurring -> RED as intended (recur=(1, 4) pruned=None kind='timeout')
MUTANT M3 --failures bucket hardcoded to other -> RED as intended (recur=(1, 3) pruned=None kind='other')
